### 1. Get all cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### 2. Get cat by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### 3. Add a new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garfield",
  "weight": 8.0
}

### 4. Get all cats again (Verify Garfield was added)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### 5. Update cat
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### 6. Delete cat
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### 7. Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### 8. Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/3609

### 9. Add a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Smith",
  "username": "alicesmith",
  "email": "alice@metropolia.fi",
  "role": "user",
  "password": "mypassword"
}

### 10. Get all users again (Verify Alice was added)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### 11. Update user
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/3609

### 12. Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/3609